          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.415:block:8",
          "start": 1370
        },
        "quote": "(2) The owner shall perform a flow test on a schedule established by the Utilities Director and submit the results, on a form provided by the Water Division, to the Utilities Director within 10 days of the test. (Ord. 20089 § 18, 10-17-17.)",
